{\begin{array}{r l}&{F l u x=40.21+5.04\times A-6.08\times B-23.09\times C+16.33\times A B}\\ &{\qquad-3.56\times A C+7.51\times B C+}\\ &{2.13\times A^{2}+1.78\times B^{2}-2.16\times C^{2}-3.61\times A B C}\end{array}}
$$
